{"id":"d5d0908b482e31f2","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-dejongh-theorem.md","title":"De Jongh–Sambin Fixed-Point Property","display":"df-dejongh-theorem — De Jongh–Sambin Fixed-Point Property","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-dejongh-theorem","aliases":["89-df-dejongh-theorem"],"display":"df-dejongh-theorem — De Jongh–Sambin Fixed-Point Property","depends_on":["[[89-df-fixed-point-modal]]","[[89-df-modal-equivalence]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-dejongh-theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-dejongh-theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-dejongh-theorem — De Jongh–Sambin Fixed-Point Property"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"02536e2efd437c59\" href=\"?note=02536e2efd437c59\" title=\"89-df-fixed-point-modal\">89-df-fixed-point-modal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2112b0932fb2c41d\" href=\"?note=2112b0932fb2c41d\" title=\"89-df-modal-equivalence\">89-df-modal-equivalence</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal M_{\\Box,p}\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal M_{\\Box,p}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\">\\(\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\)</span> 是既有不动点集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\mathrm{GL}}\">\\(\\equiv_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\)</span> 是 GL 可证等价。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DJ}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\">\\(\\mathrm{DJ}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\\)</span> 是下面定义的二参数性质。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dejongh\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{DJ}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\left[\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\\ne\\varnothing\n\\land\\forall B,C\\in\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\\;B\\equiv_{\\mathrm{GL}}C\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dejongh\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{DJ}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\left[\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\\ne\\varnothing\n\\land\\forall B,C\\in\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\\;B\\equiv_{\\mathrm{GL}}C\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 104、114–116、122；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>这是性质的定义，不在 Hypothesis 中假定它成立；成立证据由不动点存在及独立唯一性证明给出。在当前模态化域，旧弱接口与 Boolos 加强版本相容。字母界和可计算度数界比这里定义的性质更强，不能只由此定义推得。该名称与 Solovay 算术完全性是不同定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-fixed-point-modal","status":"resolved","id":"02536e2efd437c59","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-fixed-point-modal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"2112b0932fb2c41d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-equivalence]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathcal M_{\\Box,p}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\equiv_{\\mathrm{GL}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DJ}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dejongh\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{DJ}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\left[\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\\ne\\varnothing\n\\land\\forall B,C\\in\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\\;B\\equiv_{\\mathrm{GL}}C\\right].","display":true}],"bytes":1348,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-214","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-dejongh-theorem]]"}],"outgoing":["02536e2efd437c59","2112b0932fb2c41d"]}